# Rust
/target/
**/target/

# cargo-mutants build/report output (see DECISIONS.md #17).
/mutants.out/
/mutants.out.old/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
Cargo.lock.bak

# Editor / IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store

# Coverage
*.profraw
*.profdata
/lcov.info
/coverage/

# Local-only configuration
.envrc
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local data
/data/
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-journal

# TLS material
*.pem
*.crt
*.key
!docker/tls/.gitkeep

# Plans / scratch (mirrors acdp-rs convention)
plans/
temp/


.claude/
memory/
CLAUDE.md

# Lane scratch (untracked, never committed)
# Root-anchored deliberately: an unanchored `PROGRESS.md` would also hide a
# future crates/*/PROGRESS.md, which is not what this covers.
/PROGRESS.md
/.drive.lock
